kagent: accept Nix store-path images

Base: kagent-dev/kagent v1.0.1 (558e3d761d8ed2b0d23bfef1867a9d1915210121).

kagent requires every Harness, SandboxTemplate and Agent workload image to be
an OCI reference pinned by sha256 digest. A Substrate patched by ate-nix also
runs `nix:/nix/store/<hash>-<name>`, which is immutable in the same way: the
hash in the name covers the build inputs. This lets that form through the one
Go check and the three CRD patterns that would refuse it.

